hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1780","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Aag mein daala jaaeyga (Aur wo kehti hai: Kya aur zyada hai) yahan tak ke wo apna qadam rakkhey. To wo kahegi: Bas bas! (Bukhari: 4848)"
"1781","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jannat aur aag ne jhagda kya. To aag ne kaha: Mujhey mutakabbiron aur jabbaaron se tarjeeh di gai hai. Aur Jannat ne kaha: Mujhey kya hai ke mujh mein logon key kamzor aur girey huey key siwa daakhil nahi hotey. Allah ne Jannat se farmaya: Tum meri rehmat ho, main tumharey sath apne bandon mein se jise chaahta hun rehem karta hun. Aur aag se farmaya: Beshak tum mera azaab ho, main tumharey sath apne bandon mein se jise chaahta hun azaab deta hun. Aur un donon mein se har aik ka bharna hai. Lekin aag to na bharegi yahan tak ke wo apna paon rakkhey. To wo kahegi: Bas bas! To wahaan wo bharegi aur uska baaz baaz ki taraf lapeta jaaeyga. Aur Allah apni makhlooq mein se kisi par zulm nahi karta. Aur Jannat ka to beshak Allah uskey liye makhlooq paida karega. (Bukhari: 4850). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Qasam Toor ki. Aur likhi hui kitaab ki)."
